1
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:27,439
But getting into the Shen family

2
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:29,120
was what I traded

3
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:29,920
my mother's life for.

4
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:31,640
He wanted me out of the Shen family,

5
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:35,400
so I faked an asthma attack,

6
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,519
tricked him, and killed him.

7
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:38,480
I thought

8
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:39,480
I was done for.

9
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:40,920
But who would've thought?

10
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:43,040
Chen Yanzhi came to visit the Shens.

11
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:48,280
Lin Anzhe,

12
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,359
I never imagined

13
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:51,040
you killed your own mother, too.

14
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,840
Then why did you kill my mother?

15
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:58,640
Your mother was investigating Shen Xian's death.

16
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:00,400
Bad luck for her—

17
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,480
she spotted me at Chen Yanzhi's place.

18
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:04,640
She knew Shen Yu and his mother.

19
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:05,920
So,

20
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:08,240
before she could present the evidence,

21
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,520
Chen Yanzhi and I joined forces

22
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:10,520
and killed her.

23
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:12,439
You bastard!

24
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,240
You're completely inhuman!

25
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:16,000
I wish I could kill you with my bare hands!

26
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:16,719
Kill me, then!

27
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,199
Come on, kill me!

28
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,400
Kill me!

29
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:24,639
Kill me!

30
00:02:24,719 --> 00:02:25,599
Kill me!

31
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:32,960
And you, Gu Yan!

32
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,800
You deserve to die the most!

33
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:38,919
I should've made Shen Yu taste it—

34
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:41,159
made him taste

35
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,199
the pain of having a loved one murdered!

36
00:02:46,599 --> 00:02:47,680
What about the other innocent people?

37
00:02:52,719 --> 00:02:53,560
Those people?

38
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:55,159
All you see

39
00:02:55,159 --> 00:02:56,599
are the arcade tokens in the victims' hands.

40
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,319
Yet you never stopped to think

41
00:02:59,159 --> 00:03:00,319
that they're memories of my father

42
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:01,879
taking me to the arcade!

43
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:04,120
That was the happiest time of my life!

44
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,680
But he abandoned me and my mother,

45
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,199
leaving nothing behind!

46
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:15,639
With every person I killed,

47
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:18,199
I placed in their hands

48
00:03:18,199 --> 00:03:19,199
an arcade token.

49
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,479
I had to make him see

50
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:25,240
what became of the son he threw away!

51
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,080
With every single life,

52
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:28,800
I made him remember!

53
00:03:31,199 --> 00:03:32,560
That is utterly monstrous.

54
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:33,479
Lin Anzhe,

55
00:03:34,319 --> 00:03:36,120
you will face justice under the law.

56
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,080
Fine by me!

57
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:39,680
I'll gladly await my judgment!

58
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,319
Take him away.

59
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,120
Gu Yan,

60
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,919
do you remember when I first

61
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,680
applied to be your assistant,

62
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,840
that resume I gave you?

63
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:12,960
Of course I remember.

64
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:14,240
Wasn't everything on it

65
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,719
completely made up?

66
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,160
Not all of it.

67
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,600
One line was true.

68
00:04:26,199 --> 00:04:27,800
So ever since then,

69
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:29,279
you already...

70
00:04:33,839 --> 00:04:34,439
Gu Yan.

71
00:04:35,319 --> 00:04:36,360
From the start when I approached you,

72
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:38,480
got close to you,

73
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,079
and became your assistant...

74
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,120
all I wanted was to be with you.

75
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:40,800
Gu Yan,

76
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,680
all these years,

77
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,199
you've never been alone.

78
00:06:12,279 --> 00:06:12,720
Wake up.

79
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:13,519
Gu Yan.

80
00:06:13,959 --> 00:06:14,399
Gu Yan!

81
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:15,959
Hang in there!

82
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,480
Yeah, yeah.

83
00:06:41,759 --> 00:06:43,480
I know you won't let me be your assistant.

84
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,480
You're in no rush,

85
00:06:45,759 --> 00:06:46,279
but I am.

86
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:21,360
You've got cream on your lip.

87
00:07:27,319 --> 00:07:28,399
With all this stress,

88
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,759
sweets just won't cut it.

89
00:07:31,879 --> 00:07:32,519
I want a taste of you.

90
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,519
Then I'll let you have a taste.

91
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:00,439
Are you really willing to accept me?

92
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,199
Your leg...

93
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,920
Maybe we should wait until your leg heals.
